<div class="process">
  <div class="card">
    <h3>1. Clarify the plan</h3>
    <p>Budget ceiling, must-haves, timeline, and whether this is a primary residence or an investment underwrite.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>2. Search with filters</h3>
    <p>Narrow to properties that fit the plan—less noise, fewer emotional detours, clearer tradeoffs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>3. Offer and close with control</h3>
    <p>Comparable-backed offers, inspection response strategy, and coordination through closing.</p>
  </div>
</div>
